{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Huh, I'll bet...": "",
  "That extract you gave me really worked!": "",
  "Work that usually takes five hours to finish only took me ten minutes! I'll take another one, Pops!": "",
  "Sure. Bring me a Well-Used Rubber and a Worn Magnet.": "",
  "Huh? ...Why?": "",
  "Agh! My back is killing me from sitting at that desk all day... I think it's permanently crooked by now.": "",
  "Ouch, same here...": "",
  "You too, Pops? I guess picking up cans all day would do that.": "",
  "Heck no, I was boozing it up with my buddies all night and knocked out on the concrete. Didn't wake up till noon!": "",
  "Oh. I actually kind of envy you...": "",
  "All that's left is this last bit of paperwork... *sigh* Almost there...": "",
  "Tough job, eh kiddo? I bet it ain't easy being a salaryman.": "",
  "...Yeah, you could say that. Well, I should be getting back now.": "",
  "Not only is the security perimeter tight, but the vault is rock solid. Should we call in the boys for some dynamite?": "",
  "Probably. And if it's the central bank we're after, we should probably go in heavy. Assault rifles, grenades...": "",
  "Yeah, but no matter what our loadout is, special ops always takes us out in the end! Then we have to wait to respawn...": "",
  "Man, that live chat scared the shit outta me just now. Remember when the stalker barged in right at the end!?": "",
  "Ah, that was all part of the performance. Everything was blurred out anyway.": "",
  "You're right. But fuck, I paid good money for it...": "",
  "There was this guy making strange panting noises next to me a little earlier. He was shifting around all weird, too.": "",
  "Oh, that guy. I see him here all the time. He did that to me when I was eating cup ramen.": "",
  "...Bro, are you the one always making this place smell like cup ramen? They put up a warning about that outside...": "",
  "You know that guy with the messy hair who lives here? Apparently he's some kinda hacker genius...": "",
  "What? That guy's a hacker? I thought he was just some homeless dude.": "",
  "The guy next to me snored so loudly, I could barely sleep.": "",
  "I kicked his wall, banged on his door... It was like nothing would wake his ass up.": "",
  "You'll get used to it. I've been living here five years and I'm practically deaf to snoring. Same thing with bad odors!": "",
  "You had an electric shaver, right? Could I borrow it tomorrow? The bathroom's so crowded in the mornings.": "",
  "Sure, just make sure you wash it, okay?": "",
  "There was this dude who was taking a super long shit, so I ended up banging on the door, right?": "",
  "Then, all of a sudden, this super terrifying yakuza-looking dude came out! Scared the living piss outta me!": "",
  "Huh, I was just thinking you kinda smelled like piss. Did you actually wet your pants?": "",
  "No. I don't think so. Something else came out the other end, though.": "",
  "Dude. I realized something crazy... I've read almost all of the manga here.": "",
  "Bruh. That is a literal shit ton of manga. You've been here, what, five years? They should, like, build a statue of you.": "",
  "I heard they're bumping up the price of showers. 200 yen for 30 minutes.": "",
  "Really!? I can't believe it's going up by a whole 100 yen.": "",
  "I know. We should take showers together from now on!": "",
  "So I realized the other day that one of the employees here... used to go to middle school with me.": "",
  "Damn... That must've been awkward...": "",
  "Yeah. I used to bully him a lot, so it'll be hard to live here if he realizes it...": "",
  "I'm bored of hanging out at the batting center. Let's go somewhere else for a change, Yu-kun.": "",
  "No. I haven't conquered the Global Goliath course yet. I can't leave here until I do!": "",
  "Besides, I can clearly see through its pitches now. I'll show this thing who the real goliath is!": "",
  "That's what you've been saying for three days now!": "",
  "Yeah, and I've learned how to read the ball as it cuts through the air... and sense the pitcher's fighting spirit.": "",
  "What!? How can a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>robot</font_kind> have any kind of spirit at all?": "",
  "It doesn't matter. It's about the soul. And whether my opponent's human or not, my spirit's burning hot!": "",
  "I'm telling you, batting isn't for you, Yu-kun.": "",
  "Hey. Why don't we forget about baseball for just one weekend?": "",
  "Absolutely not! Didn't you fall in love with my passion for baseball!? ": "",
  "I fell in love with your passion for <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>, which is <font_kind=yakuza_italic>emphasized</font_kind> by the fact that you usually only care about baseball.": "",
  "Oogh... That's one hell of a curveball you threw just now.": "",
  "That was such a good movie, Yu-kun! ♪ I cried so much, especially at that part in the middle...": "",
  "Yeah. It was pretty emotional to see him push himself to the limit, despite being severely injured...": "",
  "No, not that part. That scene where he's struggling with love... Oh, never mind.": "",
  "Chiaki. Do you remember? That day in the sunset... when you swore to follow me to the ends of the Earth?": "",
  "Yes. And I'll still follow you, Yu-kun.": "",
  "All right! Then let's run back home to train for tomorrow's game!": "",
  "Okay! I'll be taking a cab, though.": "",
  "Then I'll just have to run faster than a cab! You ready!?": "",
  "Hey Yu-kun. You know, the Hotel District's only up the street from here... ❤": "",
  "Oh, excellent. I can rest there after I exhaust myself from training!": "",
  "That's not what I meant, Yu-kun!": "",
  "Yu-kun. It's almost been half a year since we started going out... Can't we step it up a bit?": "",
  "Yes. Humans should strive to get better with each passing day. And sportsmen must train every day!": "",
  "Chiaki! You're finally beginning to understand...!": "",
  "No! That's not what I was talking about at all... but I do like that about you.": "",
  "Do you have any dreams, Chiaki? A dream radiant and burning like the sun!?": "",
  "Yeah, I do. I was able to have that dream because I met you, Yu-kun.": "",
  "Oh? What dream is that? Go ahead, you can tell me!": "",
  "Hehehe. It's a secret...": "",
  "That guy in the white tracksuit at the batting center... I can tell he's no ordinary man.": "",
  "He's always staring at you when you're batting, Yu-kun.": "",
  "Sometimes he's smiling and sometimes he looks sad... But he's always watching you practice.": "",
  "I made lunch for you today, Yu-kun.": "",
  "Did you bring the flat cola, too?": "",
  "All right! Now I can conquer all the courses for real!": "",
  "This city's changed quite a bit. Why, I heard that Little Asia used to be North Pink Street.": "",
  "And now after the fire, it's a ruin. Might turn into Little America by next year.": "",
  "Yeah... Wait, what?": "",
  "Bantam's a real nice spot. You can drink there by yourself without feeling like you're drinking alone.": "",
  "I see... Did you know people were murdered in Bantam a long time ago?": "",
  "It used to be called Bacchus back then... Heard quite a few people died, actually.": "",
  "...By the way. Are you sure you were by yourself when you were drinking in Bantam?": "",
  "H-Hey, quit it! You're joking. You're joking, right!?": "",
  "The owner of Earth Angel is such a generous person. Oh, and elegant, too! I feel like I could tell her anything.": "",
  "Hmm. For me, I always feel this intense presence whenever I look into her eyes... like she's dealt with a lot in life.": "",
  "You sure you're not just projecting there?": "",
  "Hey, you ever notice when weird stuff happens around town? Like, the wall I was painting suddenly got taken down.": "",
  "Yeah, I know what you mean. It's funny, 'cause I had to break down this wall someone had started to paint. Oh well.": "",
  "So check this out! I saw this big ol' yakuza dude wearing a flashy shirt...": "",
  "I looked closer and realized he was flying a drone! And he had the happiest look on his face...": "",
  "Oh, that must be the \"Drone Gorilla\" all the kids've been talking about...": "",
  "Remember that incident where the Millennium Tower blew up and it rained a bunch of ten thousand yen bills?": "",
  "My dad was able to use that money to start up his own company...": "",
  "But as soon as he secured an agreement to lease an office at the Millennium Tower... it blew up again.": "",
  "...Maybe your dad should visit an exorcist.": "",
  "Kamurocho's always been dangerous. Especially after that explosion in the Millennium Tower...": "",
  "True. And there was that fire that happened here, too.": "",
  "I thought it might be peaceful for a change, but now there's a serial killer on the loose!": "",
  "Yet... after all this, somehow I can't bring myself to leave. This city's got a charm that's hard to describe.": "",
  "I saw this gorgeous girl at the Takemitsu the other day. She seemed like nothing special at first...": "",
  "But then I saw her face as the wind gently caressed her hair. Unexpectedly beautiful girls are the best!": "",
  "No, no! The most beautiful girl in Shichifuku Street is that spunky-looking girl in the white suit!": "",
  "She was going into a law office, so she must be really smart. Energetic <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> intelligent—what more could you ask for!": "",
  "Apple Pie on Tenkaichi Street is my oasis.": "",
  "Everyone's so nice there. They really seem to enjoy listening to me. Unlike everyone else I know.": "",
  "Oh? But I heard there's a spot in the back where the hostesses hang out and talk shit about their customers.": "",
  "...I hope they're not talking about me!": "",
  "I-I'm sure they're not!": "",
  "I haven't seen any coin locker keys for a while. They used to lying around everywhere.": "",
  "I heard there was this guy using the coin lockers to run weapons.": "",
  "So they're more strict about it now.": "",
  "Exactly what I'd expect from Kamurocho. The only way the law toughens up is when there's violence.": "",
  "(Shit!)": "",
  "(They all look the same to me...)": "",
  "(Not good, I can't let the target out of my sight.)": "",
  "(Hm? Is that...?)": "",
  "(Is that the lover? I'll follow them a bit longer.)": "",
  "Booze... How could I turn it down?": "",
  "Agh! Black clothes!": "",
  "N-Not a good place... Better go elsewhere!": "",
  "Ahh! Black car! I'll go another way!": "",
  "(Is he turning back? I better hide.)": "",
  "(Where can I hide?)": "",
  "(Shit. The cops?)": "",
  "Oh. I'm glad you turned around!": "",
  "Don't worry! I'm not a cop.": "",
  "Speaking of cops, the boys in blue go wild for the tits we've got in the club!": "",
  "...Goddamn barkers.": "",
  "Shit! I lost him!": "",
  "Oh no! Would tits make you feel better, sir?": "",
  "(Where did he go? Senryo Avenue? There's a sauna and a mahjong parlor there.)": "",
  "(Or could he have gone to the Champion District? That's a good place to get a drink...)": "",
  "(Think. Where would he head to next?)": "",
  "(There are only two options... Think about what he's been saying!)": "",
  "(I knew it. He must really want that drink...)": "",
  "(The color of their clothing... Could it be?)": "",
  "Aaaah! Black! White! Please, have mercy!": "",
  "Is he drunk?": "",
  "(Black and white dogs? Could it be...)": "",
  "I-It's that woman's fault...": "",
  "I can't take this anymore!": "",
  "Shit, again!": "",
  "(Mm? What happened?)": "",
  "(Is he looking for something?)": "",
  "Woah! Seriously!?": "",
  "I-I have to put this fire out!": "",
  "Whew. That was close. Was that the calamity of fire?": "",
  "(Oh, I forgot! Where did he go? I have to catch up!)": "",
  "(Hm? A yakiniku place? Please don't get roasted...)": "",
  "(All right, just leave the place.)": "",
  "(What is he looking at?)": "",
  "(A sign with a handsome host? Could it be... that he wants hair like that?)": "",
  "(A host club?)": "",
  "(Could it be... that he wants to be a host?)": "",
  "(Now that I think about it, his hair does seem a little like that of a host's...)": "",
  "(But there's a lot wrong with it...)": "",
  "*sniff* *sniff* I smell it.": "",
  "You smell Yagami!? Is that son of a bitch nearby!?": "",
  "(Damn... Here of all places?)": "",
  "(I lost sight of the target, so I guess I'll have to go around...)": "",
  "(What! That's...)": "",
  "I'll use the ten mil to move me and my wife to Bali!": "",
  "The ten million is mine!": "",
  "(Shit! What do I do!? Is there any way to go around them!?)": "",
  "(No. They'll find me!)": "",
  "(Looks like it's really getting to him...)": "",
  "Booze... Gimme some damn booze.": "",
  "Oh? Yagami-shi? Sorry, but I have my hands full right now.": "",
  "Come by again later. Although I might still be busy then.": "",
  "I have an extra rice ball, Yagami-shi. You want it?": "",
  "Hehe... Isn't it great how convenience store bentos don't go bad even at room temperature?": "",
  "Why hello there, Tak. You're looking listless as always.": "",
  "It's times like these when you should go gambling. I bet it'd be easy money for a guy like you.": "",
  "Ah, right on time, Tak. Would you mind getting rid of this for me?": "",
  "(Hey, maybe this would work well in an extract.)": "",
  "...You've been picking up weird things around town, haven't you?": "",
  "Way to go, Mari. How observant of you.": "",
  "You came at just the right time, Tak. I believe you want this?": "",
  "Oh, thank you. I will gladly take that off your hands.": "",
  "Ah, the man with the brain behind our campaign!": "",
  "Would you like to have something to eat?": "",
  "Yagami-san, good to see you! Want something to eat?": "",
  "Thanks! Come back again!": "",
  "Oh, welcome, Yagami-san. Please make yourself comfortable.": "",
  "Also, please let me know if you think of another great plan.": "",
  "Welcome, Yagami-sama. How about some coffee to help solve those cases?": "",
  "There's something peculiar about this stone... It gives off the most curious sensation when held in the palm of my hand.": "",
  "I take it that's no ordinary stone?": "",
  "Actually, I'm curious about that stone. If you don't need it, do you think I could have it?": "",
  "For you, Yagami-sama? That's certainly fine with me...": "",
  "In fact, there are plenty of them behind the café, so if I come across more, I'll give them to you.": "",
  "Excellent timing, Yagami-sama. I found this behind the café. You're more than welcome to have it, if you'd like.": "",
  "Thank you. That helps.": "",
  "Welcome to Bantam. Would you like to place an order?": "",
  "Thank you for coming by so often. We look forward to serving you again.": "",
  "*sigh* This cloth has gotten quite dirty...": "",
  "(That's what he always uses to wipe his cups. I could probably use that as a dust rag.)": "",
  "Um, if you don't mind, do you think I can have that cloth?": "",
  "Pardon? ...Well, sure, if you're fine taking this filthy rag off my hands...": "",
  "Yagami-sama. I have another dirty cloth, so would you like to have it?": "",
  "Absolutely. I'm sure I can put it to good use.": "",
  "Thank you for stopping by, Yagami-sama. Care to place an order?": "",
  "Thank you very much. We look forward to seeing you soon.": "",
  "So I was hiking in the mountains the other day, I discovered the most beautiful piece of wood...": "",
  "I thought I'd put it on display because of its striking appearance, but my customers don't like how it smells.": "",
  "(Wow. It's pretty. Could I use this for something?)": "",
  "If you don't mind, do you think I could have it?": "",
  "Ah, I'd be happy to offer it to you.": "",
  "Mountain climbing is one of my favorite hobbies, so I'll bring you more as I find them.": "",
  "Yagami-sama, I've found another rare piece of wood. Would you like to have it?": "",
  "Yes, of course.": "",
  "Yagami-san! Please, make yourself comfortable and order up a heaping helping of barbecue!": "",
  "In fact it was so good, I came here again by myself. Hahahahaha!": "",
  "Here you go, Taka! I brought you some extra drone parts!": "",
  "This ramen's so tasty, I just can't help myself!": "",
  "Back again, Yagami? Please enjoy your meal!": "",
  "Welcome, Yagami-san! We got some fresh wasabi in today.": "",
  "How about some prawns and a small dish of soy sauce mixed with grated wasabi?": "",
  "Hehe. Thanks to you, I've gotten pretty good at learning the head chef's bizarre sushi jargon.": "",
  "Welcome to our bakery, sir. What can I get you today?": "",
  "Thanks for always stopping by. Please come again.": "",
  "Take a look at this! Isn't this the most beautiful shell you've ever seen?": "",
  "I picked it up on the beach near my house. I was going to display it in the store, but I was told not to...": "",
  "(Wow. That's a beautiful shell.)": "",
  "Um, if you don't mind, do you think I can have that shell?": "",
  "Huh? Oh, sure. A lot of these wash up on the shore around where I live.": "",
  "Guess what? I found another beautiful shell, so please feel free to take it.": "",
  "Welcome, Yagami-san! How about trying one of our delicious beef bowls!?": "",
  "Hello there! The name's Hanae Ida, and I'm coming at ya with a special Smile Sale!": "",
  "Won't you satisfy your stomach with a Smile Burger? It's sure to make you smile! ♪": "",
  "Surprise! I have a wonderful present for you today! It's a four-leaf clover that's sure to bring you good luck!": "",
  "But the best way to bring happiness is to simply smile!": "",
  "Why so serious? You should put a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>smiiile</font_kind> on that face!": "",
  "Welcome! Thank you for always coming by!": "",
  "Welcome. Thank you for choosing us today.": "",
  "Yagami-san! Thanks for stopping in!": "",
  "Thanks for coming!": "",
  "Yagami-san! Here's a little present for you.": "",
  "I picked it up when I went traveling with my boyfriend.": "",
  "Nooo... I've ruined this precious cloth...": "",
  "Oh, welcome, Yagami-sama.": "",
  "Um, if you don't need it anymore, is there any chance I can have that cloth? I might actually be able to use it.": "",
  "Huh? If you don't mind it being so dirty, then go ahead and take it.": "",
  "(This might be useful for something.)": "",
  "Yagami-sama. I actually smudged up another cloth of mine. Would you care to take it?": "",
  "Hey, thanks for coming, Yagami-san. Things are going great with Miharu-chan. Hehehe.": "",
  "Thank you very much, Yagami-san.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "(Hm? Is that...?)": "(อืม? นั่นมัน...?)",
  "Booze... Gimme some damn booze.": "เหล้า... เอาเหล้ามาให้กูซักขวดสิวะ",
  "Yes, of course.": "ได้ แน่นอน",
  "Thanks for coming!": "ขอบคุณที่มานะ!"
 }
}
